==> install-targets
Usage: install.sh [flags]

Install skill package(s) into local skill homes.
Claude/Grok/Codex/Cursor: symlink. Hermes: materialized copy (default).
Optionally install thin agent cards (Claude + Grok only).

Flags:
  --help | -h
  --claude-only | --grok-only | --codex-only | --hermes-only | --cursor-only
  --all                 # all five hosts (Claude, Grok, Codex, Hermes, Cursor)
  --skill NAME          # all (default) | any skills/<name> with SKILL.md
  --from DIR            # install only basename(DIR) from that path
                        # (must contain SKILL.md); exclusive with --skill
  --agents              # also symlink agents/<leaf>.md for Claude/Grok
  --relink | --force    # replace wrong/dangling skill or agent symlinks
                        # (never clobbers a real file/directory)
  --copy                # force copy mode for all hosts (Hermes default)
  --symlink             # force symlink mode for all hosts (overrides Hermes copy)
  --status              # report install state (no writes); outcomes per host
  --uninstall           # remove only owned installs (symlink-owned or managed copy)
  --dry-run             # print actions only, no writes

Default (no host flags): install ALL five hosts.
Default (no --skill/--from): install every skills/<leaf> with SKILL.md.
Default action: install. --status / --uninstall are exclusive with each other.

Skill destinations (per skill leaf):
  Claude:  ~/.claude/skills/<dest>  (symlink)
  Grok:    ~/.grok/skills/<dest>  (symlink)
  Codex:   ~/.codex/skills/<dest>  (symlink)
  Cursor:  ~/.cursor/skills/<dest>  (symlink; never ~/.cursor/skills-cursor)
  Hermes:  ~/.hermes/skills/software-development/<dest>  (copy)
           (container bind: /opt/data/skills/software-development/<dest>)
           Provenance: ~/.hermes/skills/software-development/.skill-craft/<dest>.json
  dest = leaf. Leaf devloop skips Hermes (engine owns software-development/devloop).
  Leftover dest devloop-run is removed on Claude/Grok/Codex/Cursor.
  Grok slash: skills/devloop/commands/devloop.md → ~/.grok/commands/devloop.md

Status outcomes: absent | symlink-owned | symlink-wrong | copy-owned |
  copy-owned-stale | foreign | foreign-file
When Claude plugin inventory is available, --status also reports plugin-track
and warns on double-install only when a matching plugin is confirmed enabled.
Plugin state is confirmed-enabled only for literal JSON enabled:true; otherwise
it is cached-state-unknown or disabled.
Override inventory path: CLAUDE_INSTALLED_PLUGINS_JSON (default
~/.claude/plugins/installed_plugins.json). Set empty to skip plugin probe.

Agent destinations (only with --agents; Claude + Grok):
  Claude:  ~/.claude/agents/<leaf>.md
  Grok:    ~/.grok/agents/<leaf>.md
  Codex/Hermes: skipped (no agent install)

Sources: skills/<name> under this repo, or --from DIR.
Foreign real directories are never overwritten or uninstalled.
With --relink, only wrong or dangling symlinks are replaced.
Hermes managed copies are refreshed on re-run; foreign trees are skipped.

Exit codes:
  0  success (all requested actions completed without refusal)
  2  needs human / binding incomplete (reserved; engines)
  3  foreign-refused (install/uninstall hit unowned path)
  4  absent (uninstall: nothing owned present)
  8  drift-blocked (reserved for drift-aware uninstall)
  64 usage / flag error
